            {
                "comment": "Sarah doesn't even teach the class and she only grades the speeches, which are recorded. The TAs do the rest of the work. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 2
            },
            {
                "comment": "CA 370 was a very simple and easy course that I would totally recommend! The grading criteria was very clear and the class was asynchronous which I always appreciate. Lecture attendance is not mandatory but discussion is. Ali Rushevics is one of my favorite TA's I've ever had. She was so lovely and kind, definitely take this course! ",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
