            {
                "comment": "Sarah Jedd did not even teach this course, once every module (there are 9 modules) there is a video where she briefly explains the module and some podcasts, and that is all what she does in the course. You mostly rely on your TA to understand what is happening and where you currently are. Even feedback is from your TA.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 3
            },
            {
                "comment": "Sarah Jedd doesn't teach this class. Despite her being the professor, it's all done by the TAs. She never grades anything and never lectures. We listen to&quot;podcasts&quot; of her talking for 5 minutes",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 1
            },
            {
                "comment": "I LOVE LOVE LOVE Dr. Jedd! She is truly the sweetest person ever and has your best interest at heart. This class was not very difficult but you must show up to lecture to answer the attendance question. 10/10 recommend any class with Dr. Jedd!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Dr. Jedd is so sweet. She loves all of the material she lectures on and makes that very clear throughout her lecture. She is super understanding and always willing to work with you. She poses an attendance question each day in lecture to ensure attendance.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Sarah is the greatest, I have taken 2 classes with her now, and if I weren't graduating, I'd take more! Her lectures are clear and she gives study guides. There are points for attendance, and lots of papers but not hard. Shes available to help students, shes quirky and has cool outfits.",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "I found this course to be very informative and interesting, largely due to Professor Jedd's teaching style. She is extremely knowledgeable and well-spoken, so I always looked forward to attending her lectures. The class isn't too difficult as long as you take it seriously and try to learn something. Expectations are clearly outlined from day one.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
